i7"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.record-257bm-i7"],"id":"long.record-257bm-i7","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.95 (The binary bound after doubling)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.95, p. 71, label record:257bm-i7","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*Let $n\\ge6$ and $D\\subseteq\\{2,\\ldots,n\\}$ satisfy $2\\in D$, $Q(D,n)=2^{n-1}-1$, and $X_D(2)<1/2$. Then\n$$\nS(D,1,2n-1)<2^{n-1}.\n$$\nThe missing quotient can therefore be filled using only the ranks $n+1,\\ldots,2n-1$, without changing $D$.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-i7","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-i7","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i7%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.exists_exactRowStrictUpperExtension_two_mul_sub_one_of_exact_below%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i7%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.exists_exactRowStrictUpperExtension_two_mul_sub_one_of_exact_below%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.exists_exactRowStrictUpperExtension_two_mul_sub_one_of_exact_below"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-i7","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i7%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.localBinarySuffix_two_mul_sub_one_lt_upperWindow_of_exact_below%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edg